        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ધ્રૂજવું (dhrūjvũ) is probably inherited. CDIAL lists a Gujarati dhujvũ, \"to tremble, be shaken\", under Sanskrit dhūyate, \"is shaken\" (CDIAL 6863); the r of dhrūjvũ is not explained there, so the link is uncertain."
            }
          ]
        },
